          ],
          "text": "According to Wisconsin Central (Petitioners), according to Wisconsin Central (Petitioners), stock is not money because money is a generally accepted medium of exchange."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Dupree",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "5bc751829d164033b2750ffaf4d70747a7e1ca1c65ab537d020e8c44313412af",
