              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 24,
                "start": 24
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Dupree, congress has historically distinguished between wage\u2011based compensation covered by FICA and the narrower tax base for railroads, leading to different treatment of stock options."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Dupree",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "5bc751829d164033b2750ffaf4d70747a7e1ca1c65ab537d020e8c44313412af",
              "evidence_ids": [
